<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- A code list of the UBL example world: inhalation toxicity zone. The hazard zone of goods toxic by inhalation, modelled on the four zones of the US Hazardous Materials Regulations (49 CFR 173.116 and 173.133), with a code for goods that are not toxic by inhalation. Made by tools/build_codelists.py from world/codelists/lists.json. -->
